# Team Group BD — Current Website Baseline

**Site reviewed:** [teambd.com](https://teambd.com/)  
**Review date:** 9 September 2026  
**Scope:** the public website reachable from its live primary navigation. This is an evidence-based content and UX baseline only; no website changes or form submissions were made.

**Working-file status:** Treat this as the living backup for the renovation. Add validated facts, approved copy, design decisions, URLs, asset sources and launch checks here as the work continues.

## Executive snapshot

TEAM Group presents itself as a Bangladesh-based conglomerate spanning RMG/textiles, retail, pharmaceuticals, IT, and real estate. Its strongest messages are ethical production, sustainability, employee welfare, and an international manufacturing footprint.

The current site functions primarily as a static corporate brochure. It has a clear set of core pages and company profiles, but very few purposeful conversion paths: one contact form, external company links, two PDF profile downloads, and a generic career email. The renovation should preserve the substance, but organize it around audiences and outcomes: prospective clients, job seekers, partners, media, and community/stakeholders.

